-- Season 1 · Update 1.3: Professions & Stats category, guide posts for the new Player Guide sections,
-- and the update posts in Announcements, Server Updates and Changelog.
-- Generated by scripts/build-pages.mjs from scripts/guide-data.mjs. Only adds what is missing.

INSERT OR IGNORE INTO forum_categories (section, name, slug, description, icon, sort_order) VALUES ('OVERTHRONE Gameplay', 'Professions & Stats', 'professions-stats', 'Professions, gathering nodes, stat points and builds.', 'spark', 26);

INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Professions & Gathering Guide', '## Professions & Gathering
Level up five professions by gathering resource nodes and fighting. Every profession goes from level 1 to 100.

- **Mining** (Ore nodes): Coal, copper, iron, gold, redstone, lapis, diamond, emerald and ancient debris. Higher levels unlock the rarer ores. **Perk:** up to +20% mining speed at level 100.
- **Gemology** (Gem nodes): Amethyst, quartz and precious gems.
- **Farming** (Crop nodes): Wheat, carrots, potatoes, beetroot, pumpkins, melons and nether wart.
- **Foraging** (Tree nodes): Oak, birch, spruce, jungle, dark oak and cherry.
- **Combat** (Mob kills): Every mob you kill gives Combat XP. Stronger mobs give more. **Perk:** up to +10% melee damage at level 100.

- **1. Find a node** Nodes are blocks with **floating text** above them. The text shows the node''s profession, its level and the XP it gives.
- **2. Hit it 3 times** Hit the node **3 times** to gather it. A bar above your hotbar fills up with each hit.
- **3. Earn XP** You get **profession XP** plus some **normal level XP**. Nodes don''t drop items: they''re for levelling, not for farming resources.
- **4. Wait for the respawn** A gathered node shows a **countdown** and comes back in the same spot after **1 minute**.

- **Node levels:** your profession must be at least the node''s level to gather it. Start with level 1 nodes and work up.
- **Combat XP has a per-minute limit**, so mob farms can''t max it out. Fighting a variety of mobs and bosses is the way to level.
- **See your progress:** talk to the **Profession Master** NPC, open the **Professions** button in the Level Guide NPC, or type **/professions**.

Normal blocks everywhere else still mine and drop items like usual. Only blocks with floating text are nodes.

[Open the full Player Guide](/guide#professions)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'professions-stats'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Professions & Gathering Guide');
INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Stats & Builds Guide', '## Stats & Builds
Every level you gain gives you a stat point. Spend them to build your character the way you want to play.

Open the **Level Guide** NPC and click **YOUR STATS**, or type **/stats**. Left-click a stat to add 1 point, shift-left-click to add 5.

**Stat · Each point · Max bonus**
- **Strength**: +1% melee damage · +25%
- **Vitality**: +1% max health · +25%
- **Defense**: +1% armor · +20%
- **Attack Speed**: +1% attack speed · +15%
- **Crit Chance**: +0.5% crit chance · +10%
- **Crit Damage**: +2% crit damage · +50%
- **Dodge Chance**: +0.5% chance to dodge a hit · +5%
- **Lifesteal**: +0.5% of damage dealt healed · +5%
- **Speed**: +0.5% movement speed · +5%
- **Mining Speed**: +2% mining speed · +30%

- **Pick a build.** Every stat has a max, so you can''t put everything into one stat. Tank, glass cannon, crit build or lifesteal bruiser: it''s up to you.
- **Leftover points are saved.** Points you can''t spend yet stay in your pool for stats added in future updates.
- **Stats stack with your race and skills.** They''re percentages on top of what Tensura, Solo Leveling and your gear already give you.
- **Want a different build?** Reset all your points in the Stats menu for **500 Throne Shards** or **$2,000,000**.

[Open the full Player Guide](/guide#stats)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'professions-stats'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Stats & Builds Guide');
INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Crates, Keys & Kits', '## Crates, Keys & Kits
Crates in the hub (/warp crates) give random rewards for keys. Left-click a crate to see everything inside and the chance of each reward.

- **Voting Crate** (Vote Keys): Vote for the server every day on the [Vote page](/vote) to get Vote Keys. Rewards include diamonds, money, golden apples, Throne Shards and **claim blocks**.
- **AFK Crate** (AFK Keys): Stand in the AFK room (**/warp afk**) to earn AFK Shards. Every 6 shards (about 3 hours) become an AFK Key. Rewards include diamonds, money, Throne Shards, claim blocks, a **Legendary Key** and **Ronin, Valkyrie or Monarch kits**.
- **Kits** (/kits): Type **/kits** to open the Kit Selector: the free **Starter kit** and your rank kits, with their cooldown timers.

- **Crate menus** show rewards from most common to rarest across pages. Use the arrows at the bottom to see the rarest ones.
- **Kits won from a crate** give you that kit''s items once. They don''t give you the rank.
- **Rare rewards are announced** to the whole server when someone wins them.

[Open the full Player Guide](/guide#crates)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'economy'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Crates, Keys & Kits');

INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Season 1 · Update 1.3 is LIVE: Professions, Stats & More', '**Season 1 has begun!** Update 1.3 is the biggest update to OVERTHRONE yet. Every level you earn now makes you stronger, and there''s a whole new way to progress.

- **Stats:** get a stat point every level and build your character: damage, health, crits, dodge, lifesteal and more.
- **Professions:** level up Mining, Gemology, Farming, Foraging and Combat.
- **Gathering nodes:** hit glowing resource nodes to earn XP. They respawn every minute.
- **The AFK Crate:** kits, Legendary Keys, Throne Shards and more just for being in the AFK room.
- **The SMP world:** no claims, raiding allowed. Anything goes.
- **Lots of fixes:** smoother performance and plenty of bugs squashed.

You already have a stat point for every level you''ve reached, so open the **Level Guide** NPC and click **YOUR STATS** to spend them!

[Read the full patch notes](/forums?c=server-updates) · [Professions guide](/guide#professions) · [Stats guide](/guide#stats)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'announcements'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Season 1 · Update 1.3 is LIVE: Professions, Stats & More');
INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Update 1.3 · Season 1: Professions & Stats', '## ⚔ Stats & Builds
Every level now gives you **1 stat point**. Spend them in the **Level Guide** NPC → **YOUR STATS** (or **/stats**).
- **Strength** up to +25% melee damage
- **Vitality** up to +25% max health
- **Defense** up to +20% armor
- **Attack Speed** up to +15%
- **Crit Chance** up to +10% and **Crit Damage** up to +50%
- **Dodge Chance** up to +5% and **Lifesteal** up to +5%
- **Speed** up to +5% and **Mining Speed** up to +30%

Every stat has a max, so pick a build. Points you can''t use yet are saved for stats coming in future updates. You can reset your stats for **500 Throne Shards** or **$2,000,000**.

## ⛏ Professions
Five professions, each from level 1 to 100:
- **Mining**: ore nodes. Perk: up to +20% mining speed.
- **Gemology**: gem and crystal nodes.
- **Farming**: crop nodes.
- **Foraging**: tree nodes.
- **Combat**: killing mobs. Perk: up to +10% melee damage.

Visit the new **Profession Master** NPC or type **/professions** to see your levels.

## 💎 Gathering Nodes
- Look for blocks with **floating text**: they''re nodes.
- **Hit a node 3 times** to gather it for profession XP and bonus level XP.
- Nodes don''t drop items. A **countdown** shows when they''ll be back, and they respawn after **1 minute**.
- Higher-level nodes need a higher profession level.

## 🎁 Crates & Kits
- **New AFK Crate:** earn AFK Keys in the AFK room (**/warp afk**). Win diamonds, money, Throne Shards, claim blocks, a **Legendary Key** or a **Ronin, Valkyrie or Monarch kit**.
- Kits won from crates give you the kit''s items once. They don''t give you the rank.
- **Redesigned crate menus:** rewards are sorted from most common to rarest, with pages for the rarest rewards.
- **The Voting Crate now has claim blocks.**
- **/kits** now opens the Kit Selector menu, with the free Starter kit and your rank kits with their cooldowns.

## 🌍 Worlds
- **The SMP world (/smp):** no land claims and raiding is allowed. Anything goes.
- **/wild** now takes you to a random spot in the overworld.
- **Safe zones:** you can''t take damage in the hub or the RPG world. Everywhere else, you can.

[Professions guide](/guide#professions) · [Stats guide](/guide#stats) · [Crates & kits](/guide#crates)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'server-updates'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Update 1.3 · Season 1: Professions & Stats');
INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Changelog: Update 1.3 (Season 1)', '## Added
- Stat points: 1 per level, spent on 10 stats with a max each (Level Guide NPC → YOUR STATS, or /stats).
- Stat reset for 500 Throne Shards or $2,000,000.
- Professions: Mining, Gemology, Farming, Foraging and Combat (levels 1-100), with Mining and Combat perks.
- Gathering nodes: hit 3 times to gather, respawn after 1 minute with a countdown, no item drops.
- The Profession Master NPC, and a Professions button in the Level Guide.
- The AFK Crate with OG-style rewards, including Ronin, Valkyrie and Monarch kits and the Legendary Key.
- Claim blocks in the Voting Crate.
- The SMP world (/smp): no claims, raiding allowed.
- The Kit Selector menu (/kits) with the Starter kit.
- New Player Guide sections: Professions & Gathering, Stats & Builds, and Crates, Keys & Kits.

## Changed
- Crate menus redesigned: rewards sorted from most common to rarest, with pages.
- /wild now goes to the overworld.
- New players go to the hub once they''ve picked their race.
- The server is now backed up every night.

## Fixed
- Players sometimes couldn''t take damage anywhere. Now only the hub and the RPG world are safe zones.
- Big lag spikes: server performance is much smoother.
- The race selection screen could close on your first join.
- Kits won from crates weren''t given to players without that rank.
- The anti-cheat wrongly flagged long-reach weapons and big mobs.
- A fix is in place for races resetting after a server restart. If yours resets, open a ticket on Discord.

## Known issues
- Getting kicked with "Failed to decode packet clientbound/minecraft:custom_payload"? It''s a Solo Leveling mod bug. Fully close Minecraft and your launcher, then rejoin.', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 0, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'changelog'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Changelog: Update 1.3 (Season 1)');
